# Dev-build output — `gmake dev-build` assembles the bundle in place.
ASCII Saver.app/

*.swiftmodule
*.swiftdoc
*.dSYM

# NOTE: Resources/AppIcon.iconset/ is deliberately NOT ignored, unlike the
# equivalent line in Rainy Day's .gitignore. Rainy Day draws its icon
# procedurally with generate_icon.swift, so its iconset is a disposable
# intermediate. ASCII Saver's icon is existing artwork recovered from the old
# Xcode asset catalogue — the iconset is the only source there is, and
# AppIcon.icns is built from it by `gmake icon`.
